{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Q1sXpuzQpO1795663103.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>Annie黃婉瑩在《流行都市》「睇餸食飯」環節中，教大家烹調一道惹味家常菜「原粒豆豉雞」，只需簡單4個步驟便能完成，大家不妨一同動手試做！</p><p><strong>原粒豆豉雞｜材料、醃料及芡汁</strong></p><p><strong>材料：</strong></p><ul><li><p>雞 半隻（斬件）</p></li><li><p>豆豉 2湯匙</p></li><li><p>蒜頭 2粒</p></li><li><p>薑 2片</p></li><li><p>細青椒 半個（切角）</p></li><li><p>紅辣椒 1隻（切角）</p></li><li><p>洋蔥 1/4個（切角）</p></li><li><p>糖 1茶匙</p></li><li><p>油 1湯匙</p></li></ul><p><strong>醃料：</strong></p><ul><li><p>薑汁 1湯匙</p></li><li><p>生抽 1湯匙</p></li><li><p>鹽 1/3茶匙</p></li><li><p>糖 半茶匙</p></li><li><p>生粉 2茶匙</p></li></ul><p><strong>芡汁：</strong></p><ul><li><p>清水 5湯匙</p></li><li><p>蠔油 1湯匙</p></li><li><p>生抽 半湯匙</p></li><li><p>糖 3/4茶匙</p></li><li><p>生粉 1茶匙</p></li></ul><p><strong>原粒豆豉雞｜做法</strong></p><ol><li><p>整粒豆豉洗淨後，加入糖及油拌勻，隔水蒸5分鐘，備用。</p></li><li><p>雞件加入薑汁、生抽、鹽、糖及生粉拌勻，醃10分鐘，然後下油鍋爆炒至表面金黃，盛起備用。</p></li><li><p>原鍋爆香薑片及蒜頭，把豆豉及雞件回鍋後灒酒，再下少許芡汁炒勻。</p></li><li><p>最後放入青椒、紅辣椒及洋蔥快炒片刻，即可上碟。</p></li></ol><p><p><img alt=\"8e373331-f46c-4d82-b4d9-d51e5199f2ac.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026UvIB1wawXB1795663103.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:23:55.005606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:13.528741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:17:16.895252+00:00","content_hash":"9f8027a2e5efe36f7e4d16802c0e4651b6608954f080631e6a783b18e0f10c24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:23:55.005606+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}